hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19707","Haddathana Abd al-Razzaq, akhbarana Mamar, from al-Zuhri, from Abd Allah ibn Ubayd Allah ibn Thalabah al-Ansari, from Abd Allah ibn Zayd al-Ansari, from Mujammi ibn Jariyah, he said: I heard the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, saying: The son of Maryam will surely kill the Dajjal at the gate of Ludd, or beside Ludd."
